WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:18.808
"Eww!" worker at Trends Department Store was dressing mannequins.

2
00:00:18.828 --> 00:00:22.369
"This is an ugly blouse."

3
00:00:26.311 --> 00:00:27.872
She put a jacket on another mannequin.

4
00:00:29.164 --> 00:00:30.925
"This jacket is ugly too.

5
00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:32.485
No one will buy it!"

6
00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:36.826
Creak. The worker spun around.

7
00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:38.327
"Who's there?"

8
00:00:39.647 --> 00:00:41.308
Mannequins stood all around her.

9
00:00:42.888 --> 00:00:43.528
She laughed.

10
00:00:44.368 --> 00:00:47.689
"Silly me," she told herself.

11
00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:49.790
"I'm the only one here.

12
00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:54.911
Well, except for the—" A plastic hand grabbed her shoulder.

13
00:00:55.712 --> 00:00:56.392
She screamed.

14
00:01:00.108 --> 00:01:01.008
"Ahh!" Jack groaned.

15
00:01:01.028 --> 00:01:05.169
"Sophie, why are we here?"

16
00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:06.650
Sophie laughed.

17
00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.271
"Don't complain, Jack.

18
00:01:09.991 --> 00:01:13.072
You're spending time with me, your favorite big cousin!"

19
00:01:15.552 --> 00:01:17.073
It was Fashion Week in Metro City.

20
00:01:17.873 --> 00:01:19.614
Roxy and her friends were at a fashion show.

21
00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:23.195
Music blasted as models walked up and down the runway.

22
00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:27.256
"Thanks for bringing us here, Sophie," Mara said.

23
00:01:28.148 --> 00:01:30.690
"Jack said you study fashion design in college?"

24
00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:32.551
Sophie nodded.

25
00:01:32.571 --> 00:01:34.793
"I love fashion!

26
00:01:36.394 --> 00:01:38.035
Oh! Look at that scarf!"

27
00:01:39.276 --> 00:01:41.137
One model wore a long purple scarf.

28
00:01:42.197 --> 00:01:44.759
Another model wore a pink sweater and huge sunglasses.

29
00:01:44.779 --> 00:01:49.222
"I like those sunglasses," Mara said.

30
00:01:50.363 --> 00:01:52.164
Just then a third model walked by.

31
00:01:53.265 --> 00:01:54.866
She wore a dress covered in feathers.

32
00:01:56.907 --> 00:01:57.728
Mara snorted.

33
00:01:58.448 --> 00:02:00.530
"I don't think I like that."

34
00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:02.511
Sophie grinned.

35
00:02:02.531 --> 00:02:05.713
"I love it!"

36
00:02:06.374 --> 00:02:07.154
Jack yawned.

37
00:02:07.174 --> 00:02:10.237
"I don't care about fashion."

38
00:02:10.257 --> 00:02:13.279
"I do," Terrell said.

39
00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.820
"I think it's important to look your best."

40
00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.983
"I agree," Sophie said.

41
00:02:19.003 --> 00:02:21.584
"What about you, Roxy?"

42
00:02:21.985 --> 00:02:22.745
Terrell asked.

43
00:02:22.765 --> 00:02:24.767
"Do you like fashion?"

44
00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:26.468
Roxy shrugged.

45
00:02:27.484 --> 00:02:29.225
"I don't really care about fashion either."

46
00:02:30.746 --> 00:02:31.787
Sophie glanced over.

47
00:02:31.807 --> 00:02:33.888
"Yes, you do.

48
00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:36.669
You just don't realize it.

49
00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.131
You might not wear fancy clothes.

50
00:02:39.171 --> 00:02:41.532
But you wear things that make you feel good."

51
00:02:41.552 --> 00:02:47.295
"I just wear whatever is in my closet," Roxy said.

52
00:02:47.315 --> 00:02:49.336
"It doesn't matter what it is."

53
00:02:50.817 --> 00:02:52.358
A model walked by wearing a cape.

54
00:02:54.179 --> 00:02:54.899
Jack laughed.

55
00:02:56.428 --> 00:02:57.589
"He looks like Rocket Girl!"

56
00:02:58.629 --> 00:02:59.850
Then he tapped his chin.

57
00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.431
"It's too bad Rocket Girl isn't here.

58
00:03:03.332 --> 00:03:04.813
Maybe she could get a new costume."

59
00:03:06.374 --> 00:03:08.195
Roxy suddenly felt embarrassed.

60
00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:10.696
"What's wrong with my costume?"

61
00:03:11.096 --> 00:03:11.637
she thought.

62
00:03:13.658 --> 00:03:14.698
Terrell looked angry.

63
00:03:14.718 --> 00:03:17.840
"Rocket Girl doesn't need a new costume!

64
00:03:18.421 --> 00:03:20.081
The one she has is perfect!"

65
00:03:20.982 --> 00:03:22.183
Jack held up his hands.

66
00:03:22.203 --> 00:03:24.184
"I was just kidding!"

67
00:03:25.372 --> 00:03:26.773
Roxy smiled at Terrell.

68
00:03:27.714 --> 00:03:29.035
Just then her watch beeped.

69
00:03:31.176 --> 00:03:32.797
"I'll be right back," she said.

70
00:03:34.999 --> 00:03:36.180
Roxy went into a hallway.

71
00:03:40.203 --> 00:03:42.024
Bloom. Is everything okay?"

72
00:03:43.725 --> 00:03:44.926
Mayor Bloom looked scared.

73
00:03:44.946 --> 00:03:48.508
"Rocket Girl, you must go to Trends Department Store.

74
00:03:49.449 --> 00:03:52.311
The mannequins, they "What?"

75
00:03:52.671 --> 00:03:53.352
Roxy asked.

76
00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:55.402
"What about the mannequins?"

77
00:03:56.524 --> 00:03:57.445
Mayor Bloom gulped.

78
00:03:57.466 --> 00:04:00.551
"They came to life!"

79
00:04:00.571 --> 00:04:03.876
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

80
00:04:03.896 --> 00:04:05.979
"I'm on my way!"
